---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
import Vec from '../seqflow/Vec.astro';
import Op from '../seqflow/Op.astro';
import Box from '../seqflow/Box.astro';
import Arrow from '../seqflow/Arrow.astro';
import Badge from '../seqflow/Badge.astro';
import Legend from '../seqflow/Legend.astro';
import Stepper from '../seqflow/Stepper.astro';
import { fmt } from '../seqflow/tones';
import { pageLang } from '../../../utils/lang';

const ru = pageLang(Astro.url) === 'ru';

// The batch (1, 2, 3, 6) of one feature, eps = 1e-5, gamma = 2, beta = 0.5, PyTorch's momentum 0.1,
// running averages starting at mean 0 and variance 1; the running variance stores the unbiased batch variance.
const x = [1, 2, 3, 6], B = x.length, eps = 1e-5, gamma = 2, beta = 0.5, mom = 0.1;
const mu = x.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / B;
const v = x.reduce((a, b) => a + (b - mu) ** 2, 0) / B;
const xh = x.map((t) => (t - mu) / Math.sqrt(v + eps));
const y = xh.map((t) => gamma * t + beta);
const muRun = (1 - mom) * 0 + mom * mu, vRun = (1 - mom) * 1 + mom * (v * B) / (B - 1);
const sRun = Math.sqrt(vRun + eps);
const evalHat = (6 - muRun) / sRun, evalY = gamma * evalHat + beta;
const chk = [mu, v, ...xh.map((t) => t.toFixed(2)), ...y.map((t) => t.toFixed(2)), muRun.toFixed(1), vRun.toFixed(3), sRun.toFixed(3), evalHat.toFixed(2), evalY.toFixed(2)].join(' ');
if (chk !== '3 3.5 -1.07 -0.53 0.00 1.60 -1.64 -0.57 0.50 3.71 0.3 1.367 1.169 4.88 10.25') throw new Error(`BatchNormFlow: the example drifted (${chk})`);
const S = (a: number[]) => a.map((t) => fmt(t, 2).replace('-', '−'));
const std = `(x − ${muRun.toFixed(1)})/${sRun.toFixed(3)}`;

const t = ru
  ? {
      title: 'Батч-нормализация: режим обучения и режим оценки',
      train: 'обучение (model.train())', test: 'оценка (model.eval())', was: `при обучении: ${y[3].toFixed(2)}`, upd: '0.9 · старое + 0.1 · батч',
      steps: ['статистики батча: μ_B = 3, σ²_B = 3.5', 'стандартизация каждого значения', 'масштаб γ = 2 и сдвиг β = 0.5', 'обновление скользящих средних с коэффициентом 0.1', 'оценка: стандартизация по скользящим средним'],
      desc: 'Сверху — режим обучения: у батча (1, 2, 3, 6) среднее 3 и дисперсия 3.5; стандартизованные значения (−1.07, −0.53, 0, 1.60); после γ = 2 и β = 0.5 выход равен (−1.64, −0.57, 0.50, 3.71). Скользящие средние после одного шага: 0.3 и 1.367. Снизу — режим оценки: вход 6 стандартизуется по скользящим средним, (6 − 0.3)/1.169 = 4.88, и выход равен 10.25 вместо 3.71.',
    }
  : {
      title: 'Batch normalization in training mode and in evaluation mode',
      train: 'training mode (model.train())', test: 'evaluation mode (model.eval())', was: `training mode gave ${y[3].toFixed(2)}`, upd: '0.9 · old + 0.1 · batch',
      steps: ['batch statistics: μ_B = 3, σ²_B = 3.5', 'standardize every value', 'scale by γ = 2 and shift by β = 0.5', 'update the running averages with momentum 0.1', 'evaluation: standardize with the running averages'],
      desc: 'Top, training mode: the batch (1, 2, 3, 6) has mean 3 and variance 3.5; the standardized values are (−1.07, −0.53, 0, 1.60); after γ = 2 and β = 0.5 the output is (−1.64, −0.57, 0.50, 3.71). The running averages after one step are 0.3 and 1.367. Bottom, evaluation mode: the input 6 is standardized with the running averages, (6 − 0.3)/1.169 = 4.88, and the output is 10.25 instead of 3.71.',
    };
const id = 'norm-batchnorm-flow';
const caption = ru
  ? 'Один признак, батч из четырёх значений, ε = 10⁻⁵, обученные γ = 2 и β = 0.5, коэффициент обновления (momentum) 0.1, как в PyTorch, скользящие средние начинаются с 0 и 1. При обучении (шаги 1–3) каждое значение стандартизуется по статистикам своего батча, поэтому выход примера зависит от других примеров батча. Попутно (шаг 4) обновляются скользящие средние; дисперсия в них несмещённая, 4/3 · 3.5. В режиме оценки (шаг 5) используются они, и выход зависит только от своего входа. После одного шага скользящие средние ещё далеки от статистик батча, и тот же вход 6 даёт 10.25 вместо 3.71: режимы согласуются, только когда скользящие средние успевают установиться.'
  : 'One feature, a batch of four values, ε = 10⁻⁵, learned γ = 2 and β = 0.5, PyTorch’s momentum 0.1, running averages starting at 0 and 1. In training (steps 1–3) every value is standardized with the statistics of its own batch, so one example’s output depends on the other examples in the batch. Along the way (step 4) the running averages are updated; their variance is the unbiased one, 4/3 · 3.5. In evaluation (step 5) they are used instead, and an output depends on its own input only. After one step the running averages are still far from the batch statistics, and the same input 6 gives 10.25 instead of 3.71: the two modes agree only once the averages have had time to settle.';
---

<Figure id={id} title={t.title} caption={caption}>
  <svg class="fig-wide" viewBox="0 0 760 420" role="img" aria-labelledby={`${id}-w-t ${id}-w-d`}>
    <title id={`${id}-w-t`}>{t.title}</title>
    <desc id={`${id}-w-d`}>{t.desc}</desc>
    <text class="f-small f-t-muted" x="16" y="22">{t.train}</text>
    <Vec x={30} y={60} values={S(x)} tone="x" cw={48} label="x" />
    <g data-s="1">
      <Arrow pts={[[54, 148], [54, 192], [138, 192]]} />
      <Box x={140} y={170} w={120} h={44} label="μ_B = 3" sub="σ²_B = 3.5" />
      <Badge x={282} y={192} n={1} />
    </g>
    <g data-s="2">
      <Arrow pts={[[78, 104], [157, 104]]} />
      <Arrow pts={[[200, 170], [200, 119]]} tone="amber" />
      <Op x={200} y={104} sym="(x − μ)/σ" />
      <Arrow pts={[[241, 104], [278, 104]]} />
      <Vec x={280} y={60} values={S(xh)} tone="h" cw={52} label="x̂" />
      <Badge x={200} y={74} n={2} />
    </g>
    <g data-s="3">
      <Arrow pts={[[332, 104], [374, 104]]} />
      <Box x={360} y={170} w={100} h={44} label="γ = 2" sub="β = 0.5" tone="g" />
      <Arrow pts={[[410, 170], [410, 119]]} tone="amber" />
      <Op x={410} y={104} sym="γx̂ + β" />
      <Arrow pts={[[444, 104], [478, 104]]} />
      <Vec x={480} y={60} values={S(y)} tone="y" cw={52} label="y" />
      <Badge x={410} y={74} n={3} />
    </g>
    <g data-s="4">
      <Arrow pts={[[200, 214], [200, 248]]} />
      <Box x={120} y={250} w={200} h={44} label="μ_{run} = 0.3" sub="σ²_{run} = 1.367" />
      <text class="f-small f-t-muted" x="332" y="276">{t.upd}</text>
      <Badge x={100} y={272} n={4} />
    </g>
    <g data-s="5">
      <text class="f-small f-t-muted" x="16" y="324">{t.test}</text>
      <Vec x={30} y={341} values={['6']} tone="x" dir="row" cw={48} />
      <Arrow pts={[[240, 294], [240, 337]]} tone="amber" />
      <Arrow pts={[[78, 352], [134, 352]]} />
      <Op x={200} y={352} sym={std} />
      <Arrow pts={[[266, 352], [300, 352]]} />
      <Vec x={302} y={341} values={[evalHat.toFixed(2)]} tone="h" dir="row" cw={52} />
      <Arrow pts={[[354, 352], [374, 352]]} />
      <Op x={410} y={352} sym="γx̂ + β" />
      <Arrow pts={[[444, 352], [478, 352]]} />
      <Vec x={480} y={341} values={[evalY.toFixed(2)]} tone="y" dir="row" cw={60} />
      <text class="f-small f-t-muted" x="556" y="357">{t.was}</text>
      <Badge x={300} y={324} n={5} />
    </g>
    <Legend x={290} y={408} step={120} rows={1} />
  </svg>
  <svg class="fig-narrow seq-narrow" viewBox="0 0 360 520" role="img" aria-labelledby={`${id}-n-t ${id}-n-d`}>
    <title id={`${id}-n-t`}>{t.title}</title>
    <desc id={`${id}-n-d`}>{t.desc}</desc>
    <text class="f-small f-t-muted" x="16" y="20">{t.train}</text>
    <Vec x={20} y={50} values={S(x)} tone="x" dir="row" cw={46} label="x" labelPos="left" />
    <g data-s="1">
      <Arrow pts={[[204, 61], [282, 61], [282, 88]]} />
      <Box x={220} y={90} w={124} h={44} label="μ_B = 3" sub="σ²_B = 3.5" />
      <Badge x={252} y={50} n={1} />
    </g>
    <g data-s="2">
      <Arrow pts={[[112, 72], [112, 97]]} />
      <Arrow pts={[[220, 112], [157, 112]]} tone="amber" />
      <Op x={112} y={112} sym="(x − μ)/σ" />
      <Arrow pts={[[112, 125], [112, 148]]} />
      <Vec x={20} y={150} values={S(xh)} tone="h" dir="row" cw={46} label="x̂" labelPos="left" />
      <Badge x={34} y={112} n={2} />
    </g>
    <g data-s="3">
      <Arrow pts={[[112, 172], [112, 213]]} />
      <Box x={220} y={206} w={124} h={44} label="γ = 2" sub="β = 0.5" tone="g" />
      <Arrow pts={[[220, 228], [150, 228]]} tone="amber" />
      <Op x={112} y={228} sym="γx̂ + β" />
      <Arrow pts={[[112, 241], [112, 260]]} />
      <Vec x={20} y={262} values={S(y)} tone="y" dir="row" cw={46} label="y" labelPos="left" />
      <Badge x={34} y={228} n={3} />
    </g>
    <g data-s="4">
      <Arrow pts={[[282, 134], [282, 148]]} />
      <Box x={220} y={150} w={124} h={44} label="μ_{run} = 0.3" sub="σ²_{run} = 1.367" />
      <Badge x={210} y={139} n={4} />
    </g>
    <g data-s="5">
      <text class="f-small f-t-muted" x="16" y="320">{t.test}</text>
      <Vec x={16} y={334} values={['6']} tone="x" dir="row" cw={40} />
      <Arrow pts={[[56, 345], [84, 345]]} />
      <Op x={150} y={345} sym={std} />
      <Arrow pts={[[216, 345], [234, 345]]} />
      <Vec x={236} y={334} values={[evalHat.toFixed(2)]} tone="h" dir="row" cw={46} />
      <Arrow pts={[[259, 356], [259, 381]]} />
      <Op x={259} y={395} sym="γx̂ + β" />
      <Arrow pts={[[225, 395], [164, 395]]} />
      <Vec x={102} y={384} values={[evalY.toFixed(2)]} tone="y" dir="row" cw={60} />
      <text class="f-small f-t-muted" x="16" y="440">{t.was}</text>
      <Badge x={80} y={395} n={5} />
    </g>
    <Legend x={16} y={480} step={170} rows={2} />
  </svg>
  <Stepper steps={t.steps} />
</Figure>
